# libbrotli notice

This directory contains the decode-only subset of Google's libbrotli, version 1.1.0.

Source: https://github.com/google/brotli/releases/tag/v1.1.0

Only the decoder path is vendored (c/common/, c/dec/, and the public headers in
c/include/brotli/). The encoder (c/enc/) is NOT included, as this project only
needs decompression.

The C source is compiled into a static library by build.rs using the `cc` crate,
so the final binary has no runtime dependency on a system libbrotli.

